  "source_detail": "Q1 of docs/plans/separate-the-record/PLAN.md — where a rejected alternative lives, and who is told to read it",
  "explanation": "The lead drops an alternative before any reviewer sees it, and today the only place that survives is the specification — so [the reader who must not re-propose it](#reviewer-side) and [the reader who should never see it](#worker-side) get the same words. Follow what reaches the worker under each of [the three answers](#answers): only giving it a home in the record keeps the specification clean without losing the reason. Leaves out review findings, which already have a home and a no-re-raise rule.",
